## Troubleshooting and Support Resources

### Common Issues Encountered

| Issue                            | Possible Cause                                  | Resolution                                                       |
| -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Resource deployment failed       | Invalid resource name or unavailable region     | Verify naming requirements and select a supported region         |
| Budget not generating alerts     | Alert threshold not configured                  | Review budget settings and notification recipients               |
| Unable to access Cost Management | Insufficient permissions                        | Confirm account has appropriate subscription access              |
| MFA setup issues                 | Authenticator app not linked correctly          | Re-register the authentication method and verify device settings |
| Resource Group creation failed   | Subscription limitations or policy restrictions | Check subscription status and Azure policies                     |

